# C4 Model - Context Diagram Template

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "External Systems"
        ExtAPI[External Payment API]
        EmailSvc[Email Service]
        AuthProvider[Auth Provider]
    end
    
    subgraph "Our System"
        System[E-Commerce Platform]
    end
    
    User[Customer] --> System
    Admin[Administrator] --> System
    
    System --> ExtAPI
    System --> EmailSvc
    System --> AuthProvider
    
    style System fill:#1f77b4,color:#fff
    style User fill:#ff7f0e,color:#fff
    style Admin fill:#2ca02c,color:#fff
```

## Usage
Show your system at the highest level with users and external systems.